ent-RUMCCellLeadAcid = lead-acid cell
    .desc = A heavy cell of lead plates in acid. It holds more than the high-capacity cell, is cheap to make, and is bulky.
ent-RUMCCellSilverZinc = silver-zinc cell
    .desc = A cell of silver and zinc plates in a caustic bath. It stores half as much again as the lead cell and is light for it.
ent-RUMCCellCobalt = cobalt cell
    .desc = The best cell the colony can make, of cobalt and silver in plastic, holding twice as much as the hyper-capacity cell of the game. It is costly.
